Z||000005||Ken Wittlief||11-07-2001||05:16 PM||||it makes perfect sense to me. I saw K-PAX last week and Im willing to bet they edited it to take out any shots of the WTC.<P> why?! cause if you are watching a movie about a guy who says hes from another planet, you dont want to be 'inetrrupted' in the middle of the movie by a background shot of the WTC, and suddenly be reminded of the horror that happened there.<P> I noticed they change the commercial for those quit smoking patches, the one with the frizzy hair lady on the patio smoking, and the guy askes her if she wanted to be alone...<BR> <BR>and she asks him if he still gets cravings using the patch.<P> before he said, "well I not going to jump - pointing to the ten story drop off the patio"<P> now his voice is dubbed, and he saids, "well Im not going crazy".<P>  so yes, it is being edited out of everyday things - its such a gut reaction when you see the towers, thats not what most people are trying to elicit with their ads and tv shows and movies.||||reg||10
